{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Earthly FAQs",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}

<div class="earthly-faqs-wrapper">
  <div id="vsFaqSection" class="vs-section-has-top-divider vsfaqs-section">
    <svg width="1440" height="111" viewBox="0 0 1440 111" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
      <g clip-path="url(#clip0_faqs)">
        <rect width="1440" height="110" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 110.696)" fill="white"/>
        <path d="M0 61.1958L80 68.0708C160 74.9458 320 88.6958 480 77.2231C640 65.9224 800 28.9692 960 26.8208C1120 24.6724 1280 56.4692 1360 72.6685L1440 88.6958V-21.3042H1360C1280 -21.3042 1120 -21.3042 960 -21.3042C800 -21.3042 640 -21.3042 480 -21.3042C320 -21.3042 160 -21.3042 80 -21.3042H0V61.1958Z" fill="#F2FBEA"/>
      </g>
      <defs>
        <clipPath id="clip0_faqs">
          <rect width="1440" height="110" fill="white" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 110.696)"/>
        </clipPath>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faqs-section">
    <div class="vs-earthly-container">
      <h2 class="vs-earthly-font45"><em>Any Questions?</em> <br> Let us answer them!</h2>
      <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faqs-inner">
{% if product.handle contains 'african' or product.handle contains 'black' %}

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Turmeric or Black - Which is right for me?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p><strong>Turmeric Glow Bar → Brightening &amp; Even Skin Tone</strong><br>Best for dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and dull skin. It evens out complexion, boosts radiance, and gently cleanses without drying.</p>
            <p><strong>African Black → Acne, Blemishes &amp; Dark Spots</strong><br>Best for acne, breakouts, and post-acne marks. It deeply cleanses, controls oil, and helps fade blemishes while calming irritation.</p>
            <p><strong>Can I Use Both?</strong><br>Yes! Many customers use Turmeric in the morning for glow &amp; brightness, and Black Soap at night for deep cleansing &amp; acne control.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Can this clear my acne and breakouts?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Yes. The natural plant ash lifts the oil and dead skin that clog your pores, then clears the bacteria that turns them into breakouts. So acne is dealt with at the source, not just covered up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Will it work if nothing else has?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Most people who try this have already been through the harsh actives and washes that didn't work.<br><br>This works differently, by cleaning deep into the pores instead of stripping the surface, which is why so many who'd given up tell us it's the one that finally worked.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Can I use it every day?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Yes, once your skin is used to it. Start a few times a week, then build up to daily as your skin adjusts. Always follow with a moisturiser to keep your skin balanced.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Can I use it on my body, not just my face?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Absolutely. It works just as well on body breakouts, including the back, chest and shoulders. Lather it in your hands and massage the foam over the area, then rinse.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Will it dry my skin out?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>It's a deep cleanser, so it can feel drying if you overuse it or skip moisturiser. Use a few times a week to start, and always follow with a moisturiser.<br><br>Most people find it leaves skin clean and balanced rather than tight.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>What if it doesn’t work for me?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>We offer a <strong>100% money-back guarantee</strong>. If you’re not happy with your results after <strong>60 days</strong>, contact us for a <strong>full refund</strong>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
  
{% else %}

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Will this help with hyperpigmentation and melasma?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>The <strong>antioxidants in turmeric help reduce hyperpigmentation and melasma</strong>, making skin appear <strong>more even-toned over time</strong>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>How long before I see results?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Many customers notice a <strong>brighter complexion within 7-14 days</strong>, with <strong>dark spots fading significantly in 30 days</strong>. Consistency is key!</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>How do I use the Turmeric Bar for the best results?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p><strong>Face:</strong> Lather, apply for <strong>60-90 seconds</strong>, then rinse. Follow with a natural moisturizer or butter such as shea butter.</p>
            <p><strong>Body:</strong> Use daily in the shower, focusing on <strong>dark spots or uneven areas</strong> (e.g., underarms, bikini line, knees).</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Can I use this bar every day?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Yes! Our soap is 100% natural, gentle, and free from harsh chemicals, making it safe for daily use on both the face and body.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Is this safe for sensitive skin?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Yes, but we always recommend doing a quick patch test behind your ear or inside your wrist before full use.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Can I use this on my bikini line or underarms?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>Absolutely. It is formulated specifically to target dark spots and razor bumps on delicate areas like underarms and bikini lines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>Will the turmeric stain my skin or clothes?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>No, our bar rinses off completely clean without leaving yellow stains on your skin.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>How long does one bar last?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>With daily use, one bar lasts approximately 3 to 4 weeks. Keep it on a dry soap dish between uses to maximize its lifespan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item">
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb">
            <span>What if it doesn't work for me?</span>
            <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button">+</div>
          </div>
          <div class="vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel">
            <p>You're covered by our 60-Day Clear Skin Guarantee. If you're not satisfied, email our friendly support team for a full refund.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      
{% endif %}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.vs-earthly-pdp-faqs-section {
  background-color: #F2FBEA;
  padding: 40px 20px 70px 20px;
}
.vs-earthly-container {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.vs-earthly-font45 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 40px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #111111;
  margin: 0 0 36px 0;
}
.vs-earthly-font45 em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: #2C5801;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faqs-inner {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #dce8d5;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb {
  padding: 16px 20px;
  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #2C5801;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel {
  display: none;
  padding: 0 20px 18px 20px;
  font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #4a4a4a;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item.active .vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-panel {
  display: block;
}
.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item.active .vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-button {
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}
</style>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  var thumbs = document.querySelectorAll('.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item-thumb');
  thumbs.forEach(function(th) {
    th.addEventListener('click', function() {
      var item = this.closest('.vs-earthly-pdp-faq-item');
      item.classList.toggle('active');
    });
  });
});
</script>